phwstyle bundles the following third-party material.

1. Ubuntu font family (inst/fonts/*.ttf)
   Copyright 2010-2011 Canonical Ltd.
   Licensed under the Ubuntu Font Licence, Version 1.0 (inst/fonts/UFL.txt).
   The files in inst/fonts are unmodified.

   inst/css/phw-fonts-embedded.css contains a Modified Version (subset to
   Latin and Welsh characters and converted to WOFF2). As section 2(c) of the
   licence requires, it is renamed "Ubuntu derivative phwstyle" and remains
   under the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0.

2. Public Health Wales logo (not bundled)
   phwstyle does not include the Public Health Wales logo. The bilingual
   "Iechyd Cyhoeddus Cymru / Public Health Wales" logo and the NHS Wales
   roundel are trade marks of Public Health Wales and NHS Wales.
   phw_download_logos() downloads the logo from phw.nhs.wales to the user's
   cache folder only when the user asks, and options(phwstyle.logo_dir)
   points phwstyle to a copy from an approved logo pack. The logo is not
   covered by the package's MIT licence; use it only in line with NHS Wales
   and Public Health Wales brand guidance.

3. Colour values
   The Pantone 534 and 465 RGB values come from the NHS Wales Logo
   Guidelines (Welsh Government, July 2022). Other colours were measured
   from public Public Health Wales materials. Colour values are facts and
   are not subject to copyright.

All other graphics in inst/graphics are drawn by phwstyle
(data-raw/build-graphics.R) and are covered by the MIT licence.
